    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "MoonBit",
      "source_hash": 9897507611595500959,
      "context_hash": 4601661697278043031,
      "translation": "MoonBit",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:56.138384Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[MoonBit](https://www.moonbitlang.com/) is a programming language that provides first-class support for modern WebAssembly, including WebAssembly components.",
      "source_hash": 1820001452524438489,
      "context_hash": 9319134691184113833,
      "translation": "[MoonBit](https://www.moonbitlang.com/)는 WebAssembly 컴포넌트를 포함한 최신 WebAssembly를 일급으로 지원하는 프로그래밍 언어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:56.138385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This guide demonstrates how to build WebAssembly components using MoonBit, leveraging WIT (WebAssembly Interface Types) for interface definitions and the `wit-bindgen` toolchain for code generation.",
      "source_hash": 2695154389438510579,
      "context_hash": 489882713846746265,
      "translation": "이 가이드는 인터페이스 정의를 위해 WIT(WebAssembly Interface Types)를 활용하고 코드 생성을 위해 `wit-bindgen` 툴체인을 사용하여 MoonBit로 WebAssembly 컴포넌트를 빌드하는 방법을 보여줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:56.138385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This tutorial walks through building a component that implements the [`adder` world][adder-wit] defined in the `docs:adder` package.",
      "source_hash": 3470239040243523091,
      "context_hash": 10634025951469111881,
      "translation": "이 튜토리얼은 `docs:adder` 패키지에 정의된 [`adder` 월드][adder-wit]를 구현하는 컴포넌트를 빌드하는 과정을 안내합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트",
        "world": "월드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:56.138385Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The component will export an `add` interface containing an `add` function that sums two numbers.",
      "source_hash": 14118342739829874723,
      "context_hash": 543383478062603474,
      "translation": "이 컴포넌트는 두 숫자를 더하는 `add` 함수를 포함하는 `add` 인터페이스를 내보냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:56.138386Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
