      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Ensure your `gen/moon.pkg.json` is properly configured for WebAssembly target:",
      "source_hash": 7466155110549865373,
      "context_hash": 12311490632819573938,
      "translation": "`gen/moon.pkg.json`이 WebAssembly 타겟에 맞게 올바르게 설정되었는지 확인하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "5.",
      "source_hash": 17772220482873900580,
      "context_hash": 13010942486925620702,
      "translation": "5.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Build the WebAssembly Component",
      "source_hash": 8502576082562631597,
      "context_hash": 16137496891771456156,
      "translation": "WebAssembly 컴포넌트 빌드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Build the MoonBit code to WebAssembly core module:",
      "source_hash": 1119365222693610574,
      "context_hash": 3511542301880368149,
      "translation": "MoonBit 코드를 WebAssembly 코어 모듈로 빌드하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "To create a proper WebAssembly component from the module we have produced, use `wasm-tools`:",
      "source_hash": 14293337012403313631,
      "context_hash": 16238654180531863013,
      "translation": "생성한 모듈로부터 올바른 WebAssembly 컴포넌트를 만들려면 `wasm-tools`를 사용하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "You can verify the component's interface using `wasm-tools`:",
      "source_hash": 1465503664616119431,
      "context_hash": 15807781000114263299,
      "translation": "`wasm-tools`를 사용하여 컴포넌트의 인터페이스를 확인할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The WIT printed should be similar if not exactly the same as the following:",
      "source_hash": 16316730556589131612,
      "context_hash": 12026877666119391628,
      "translation": "출력되는 WIT는 다음과 완전히 동일하지는 않더라도 유사해야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "6.",
      "source_hash": 13345099316864472065,
      "context_hash": 13522877314408811629,
      "translation": "6.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Testing the Component",
      "source_hash": 4656220363945720440,
      "context_hash": 18392050572351225997,
      "translation": "컴포넌트 테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Using the Example Host",
      "source_hash": 15173859162401093314,
      "context_hash": 9025924775064706408,
      "translation": "예제 호스트 사용하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "To test your component, use the [`example-host`][example-host] provided in this repository:",
      "source_hash": 4911898847510940176,
      "context_hash": 5166333005763880249,
      "translation": "컴포넌트를 테스트하려면 이 저장소에서 제공하는 [`example-host`][example-host]를 사용하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Expected output:",
      "source_hash": 10800903561598352120,
      "context_hash": 500619182322988634,
      "translation": "예상 출력:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Using Wasmtime",
      "source_hash": 6198529538692927598,
      "context_hash": 2109941981943829140,
      "translation": "Wasmtime 사용하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "You can also test the component directly with `wasmtime`:",
      "source_hash": 6961022445058886321,
      "context_hash": 11123335290215140121,
      "translation": "`wasmtime`으로 컴포넌트를 직접 테스트할 수도 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Advanced",
      "source_hash": 835417650835742317,
      "context_hash": 3209210929279914706,
      "translation": "고급",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "--derive-eq --derive-show",
      "source_hash": 1767689295084882534,
      "context_hash": 15457446759101441116,
      "translation": "--derive-eq --derive-show",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "These two options will add `derive(Eq)` and / or `derive(Show)` for all the generated types.",
      "source_hash": 5217218504699592428,
      "context_hash": 1700333125880158883,
      "translation": "이 두 옵션은 생성된 모든 타입에 `derive(Eq)` 및/또는 `derive(Show)`를 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "--derive-error",
      "source_hash": 15809538449378574626,
      "context_hash": 12396409433236040178,
      "translation": "--derive-error",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:55.096152Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This option will generate variants / enums whose names containing 'Error' as [suberrors](https://docs.moonbitlang.com/en/latest/language/error-handling.html#error-types).",
      "source_hash": 16681057072157310700,
      "context_hash": 12598042778261910334,
      "translation": "이 옵션은 이름에 'Error'가 포함된 variant/enum을 [서브에러](https://docs.moonbitlang.com/en/latest/language/error-handling.html#error-types)로 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769369Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This allows you to integrate the MoonBit's error handling easier.",
      "source_hash": 15670844712505640367,
      "context_hash": 13542359804915961311,
      "translation": "이를 통해 MoonBit의 에러 처리를 더 쉽게 통합할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "For example, for the following interface:",
      "source_hash": 16724610790525342545,
      "context_hash": 1335957850916182905,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 다음 인터페이스에 대해:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Will generate the following type and function",
      "source_hash": 18330797739400507992,
      "context_hash": 5832478804070442078,
      "translation": "다음 타입과 함수를 생성합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "which you may use it as:",
      "source_hash": 18423874296403817627,
      "context_hash": 559685890857531682,
      "translation": "다음과 같이 사용할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769370Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "--ignore-stub",
      "source_hash": 10039968851639425364,
      "context_hash": 12791892227079274946,
      "translation": "--ignore-stub",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "It happens when you would like to regenerate the project due to the updated interface, but you don't want the `stub` file to be touched.",
      "source_hash": 14305110560222860563,
      "context_hash": 3928238430664099316,
      "translation": "이는 업데이트된 인터페이스로 인해 프로젝트를 다시 생성하고 싶지만, `stub` 파일이 변경되는 것을 원하지 않을 때 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "You may use `--ignore-stub` option to avoid such modifications.",
      "source_hash": 9263470381424465536,
      "context_hash": 4380533832065125844,
      "translation": "이러한 수정을 피하려면 `--ignore-stub` 옵션을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "--project-name",
      "source_hash": 4108170433685468632,
      "context_hash": 9119751974332060681,
      "translation": "--project-name",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, the project name is generated per the name defined in the MoonBit file.",
      "source_hash": 17113020190776256187,
      "context_hash": 14376430646030742024,
      "translation": "기본적으로 프로젝트 이름은 MoonBit 파일에 정의된 이름에 따라 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "You may use this option to specify the name of the project.",
      "source_hash": 10144858780350385357,
      "context_hash": 5459712120465605976,
      "translation": "이 옵션을 사용하여 프로젝트의 이름을 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:14/seg:2",
      "source": "It can also be used if you are generating the project as part of a larger project.",
      "source_hash": 14843073632528394093,
      "context_hash": 9512332925215730630,
      "translation": "더 큰 프로젝트의 일부로 프로젝트를 생성하는 경우에도 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "--gen-dir",
      "source_hash": 15033893836747005292,
      "context_hash": 2252087312467845440,
      "translation": "--gen-dir",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "By default, the exportation parts are generated under `gen`.",
      "source_hash": 17981182178569171138,
      "context_hash": 15553200830803183355,
      "translation": "기본적으로 내보내기 부분은 `gen` 아래에 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "You may use this option to specify another directory.",
      "source_hash": 10965451951366389639,
      "context_hash": 414889032804788914,
      "translation": "이 옵션을 사용하여 다른 디렉터리를 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:46:42.769371Z",
      "issues": []
    },
